  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rn&#xe4;mneskontroll 1999</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nuclear Security 1999 - Nuclear Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen ing&#xe5;r som del i ett stort projekt d&#xe4;r Statens K&#xe4;rnkrafts- inspektion SKI bedriver samarbete med l&#xe4;nderna i det forna Sovjet f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka deras m&#xf6;jligheter att f&#xf6;rhindra spridning av k&#xe4;rnvapen. Denna insats g&#xe4;ller en teknisk st&#xf6;dfunktion (1 tj&#xe4;nst) inom den internationella juristgruppen ILG, som &#xe4;r genomf&#xf6;rande part i projek.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish SKI is carrying out a co-operation project with the former countries of the Sovjet Union to prevent circulation of nuclear weapons. This part of the project concerns a technical secretary/ co-ordinator within the International Group of Legal Experts ILG. ILG will together with SKI carry out and implement the project.</narrative>
  </description>
